Vendored third-party single-header libraries.

- stb_image.h — Sean Barrett et al. Dual-licensed: public domain (Unlicense) OR
  MIT. Used by the timui.h library implementation as a PNG-only, no-stdio,
  bounded decoder for Sixel pixels, and by dev tooling.
  https://github.com/nothings/stb

- stb_image_write.h, stb_truetype.h, stb_image_resize2.h — Sean Barrett et al.
  Dual-licensed: public domain (Unlicense) OR MIT. Used only by dev tooling
  (`tools/vt_gif.c`), not by the timui.h library API.
  https://github.com/nothings/stb

- msf_gif.h — Miles Fogle.
  Dual-licensed: MIT OR public domain (Unlicense).
  https://github.com/notnullnotvoid/msf_gif

- vt_font_ttf.h — a subset of DejaVu Sans Mono (Bitstream Vera Fonts + DejaVu
  license; freely redistributable), embedded as a byte array. Regenerate with
  `make gen-font-ttf` (tools/gen_font_ttf.py). vt_gif rasterizes it at runtime
  with stb_truetype.

- emoji_atlas.h — a curated set of Twemoji colour-emoji PNGs
  (https://github.com/twitter/twemoji), graphics licensed CC-BY 4.0
  (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/), embedded as PNG byte arrays.
  Regenerate with `make gen-emoji` (tools/gen_emoji.py).

- vt_font_cjk.h — CJK 16x16 bitmaps from GNU Unifont (https://unifoundry.com/
  unifont/), dual-licensed OFL-1.1 / GPLv2+-with-font-exception; used here under
  the OFL. Packed + deflate-compressed; vt_gif inflates once at startup.
  Regenerate with `make gen-cjk` (tools/gen_cjk.py).

- SheenBidi/ (Source/ + Headers/, v3.0.0) — Muhammad Tayyab Akram's Unicode
  Bidirectional Algorithm (UAX #9) implementation, Apache-2.0 (upstream LICENSE
  kept verbatim at SheenBidi/LICENSE). https://github.com/Tehreer/SheenBidi
  OPT-IN ONLY: the chat example's cheap bidi approximation stays the default;
  `make ... WITH_SHEENBIDI=1` defines CHAT_SHEENBIDI and links the amalgamation
  (Source/SheenBidi.c, -DSB_CONFIG_UNITY) for correct logical->visual reordering.

Additional single-file libraries used by the internet-radio example
(examples/radio.c) — audio decode/output + spectrum FFT; likewise not part of
the timui.h library or its distributed header.

- minimp3.h — lieff. Public domain (CC0-1.0). MP3 frame decode to PCM.
  https://github.com/lieff/minimp3 (commit 7b590fd, 2025).

- miniaudio.h — David Reid (mackron). Dual-licensed: public domain (Unlicense)
  OR MIT-0. Cross-platform audio playback (CoreAudio on macOS).
  https://github.com/mackron/miniaudio (commit 9634bed, 2025).

- kiss_fft.{h,c}, kiss_fftr.{h,c}, _kiss_fft_guts.h, kiss_fft_log.h —
  Mark Borgerding. BSD-3-Clause. Real-input FFT for the spectrum analyzer.
  https://github.com/mborgerding/kissfft (commit 6398d8a, 2025).

- sqlite3/ (sqlite3.c + sqlite3.h) — the SQLite amalgamation, version 3.53.3
  (SQLITE_SOURCE_ID 2026-06-26 20:14:12 d4c0e51e4aeb96955b99185ab9cde75c339e2c29
  c3f3f12428d364a10d782c62). Public domain (SQLite has no license; the authors
  dedicate it to the public domain). From https://sqlite.org/2026/sqlite-
  amalgamation-3530300.zip. Used ONLY by the example examples/sqlite_tui.c
  (NOT part of the timui.h library or its distributed header).
